  "_readme": [
    "Curation layer for the Koine course. This file holds ONLY what a corpus cannot supply:",
    "English glosses, multiple-choice distractors, teaching notes, and — where the corpus",
    "cannot derive a stem — an explicit `stem` override.",
    "",
    "Everything else (stem/ending split, letter indices, morphological parse, attestations,",
    "frequency) is derived by scripts/import-morphgnt.mjs from MorphGNT.",
    "",
    "NEEDS SPECIALIST REVIEW. Glosses are standard NT lexical meanings kept deliberately short",
    "for teaching; they flatten real semantic range and are not lexicon entries. Every `stem`",
    "override below is a hand judgement and should be checked first.",
    "",
    "`lemma` must match MorphGNT's lemma field exactly."
  ],

